+/*
+ * mode 3, inline (patch 49): r = sign | e : m rounded by `rest` (its top
+ * bit half an ulp) to nearest-even -- x87f_pack_x as TCG ops. z nonzero
+ * makes the result a signed zero (an operand was zero) and skips the range
+ * check; otherwise a pre-rounding e outside 1..0x7ffd (overflow, tininess)
+ * branches to slow. e, m and rest are clobbered.
